# A tab closed while its DevTools are open, on a page that asks "Leave site?" (a shop
# with something in its cart). Chromium still ran the page's beforeunload despite the forced
# close, so the closed page and its window stayed over the next tab. The page must close: its
# renderer (file://, a process of its own) and DevTools' go, back to the baseline.
budget rss=600 stalls50=5
niche://open?url=${PAGE}?n=first
wait 3
helpers baseline
niche://open?url=file://${FIXTURES}/Pages/page.html?beforeunload=1
wait 3
niche://debug?cdp=Runtime.evaluate&params=%7B%22expression%22%3A%20%22document.body.click%28%29%22%2C%20%22userGesture%22%3A%20true%7D
wait 1
niche://action/devTools
wait 4
niche://action/closeTab
wait 3
helpers settle 0
